@TestInter_HostAddress = http://localhost:5192
@token = 
@createdStudentId = 

### Login (JWT)
@name login
POST {{TestInter_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Email": "student1@school.com",
  "Password": "Pass123!"
}

### List catalog courses
GET {{TestInter_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

# Set @createdStudentId manually with the returned id before calling requests that use /api/students/{{createdStudentId}}.
### List students
GET {{TestInter_HostAddress}}/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get student by id
GET {{TestInter_HostAddress}}/api/students/{{createdStudentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

